        {
          "page": 2,
          "text_chars": 786,
          "text_preview": "Some Tips For Teacher 1, This guide is NOT for one class time, you can finish it in many times. 2, This guide is just a topic guide ,it’s not a strictly study guide.You don’t need to ask questions one",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "text_chars": 735,
          "text_preview": "Learning objective 1, Key words: trail,chop,woodcutter,firewood,wise,side,temple,confused,master,parent,future,live,rude,exercise, secret,message,ocean, 2, Key   sentences: None of the other students ",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 4,
          "text_chars": 144,
          "text_preview": "Warm up . 1,Do you go to school everyday? What does your teacher look like?             2,Do you like learning from your teacher? Why or why not? P4",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 5,
          "text_chars": 20,
          "text_preview": "Video Time(0-2:11) P5",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "text_chars": 303,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1,What can you see in the pictures?                  2,What did the monkey go to find ? 3, Have you ever sailed on the ocean? Have you ever on a boat? 4, Where did The monkey finally",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 7,
          "text_chars": 126,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, How many years did The monkey travel? 2,Why did these people look scared? 3, Did The monkey find the sage? . P7",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 8,
          "text_chars": 159,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Why was the monkey sad?             2,What was the monkey looking for in the mountains? ( Remember to ask Ss to say in complete sentences.) P8",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 9,
          "text_chars": 223,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, What was the man’s job?                 2, What was the man doing? 3, What did the woodcutter say?          4, Why  was The monkey excited?               ( Remember to ask Ss to s",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 10,
          "text_chars": 267,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1, Was there any sages live in this mountain? What was the sage’s name? 2, How could The monkey find this sage? 3, What did The monkey see finally?   4, Where was the temple? Who liv",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
          "page": 11,
          "text_chars": 257,
          "text_preview": "Learn More Tips : 1,  Where were they? What were they doing? What can you see in the classroom? 2,  How many students were there? Who was their teacher? 3,   What did Subodhi speak to the oldest stude",
          "notes_preview": "",
          "notes_available": false
        },
        {
